    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81611" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικύκλ-ιον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>periphery,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Corp.Herm.
				3.2b
			</span></i> codd. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίκυκλ-ος</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οϝ</span>, <i>all round, spherical</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				34
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Στέφανος</span>”
