				<u>Aut.</u>
				4.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.755a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				336.24
			</span></i> : in earlier writers divisim, as <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				112e
			</span></i>.</div>
